60},{"_76":77,"_78":1389,"_80":1766,"_82":1391,"_84":85,"_86":60},{"_76":88,"_78":1386,"_90":1763,"_82":50,"_84":-7},{"_76":88,"_78":1378,"_90":1758,"_82":88,"_84":-7},{"_76":1359,"_78":1370,"_1361":1362,"_90":1753,"_82":1372,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1365,"_1361":1362,"_90":1752,"_82":1367,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1360,"_1361":1362,"_90":1751,"_82":1364,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1356,"_80":1430,"_82":1358,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1353,"_80":1354,"_82":1355,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_82":1350,"_78":1351,"_80":1750,"_86":87},{"_76":88,"_82":1345,"_78":1346,"_90":1747},[1748],{"_78":1427,"_50":1749},"https://cs.stanford.edu/~sunfanyun/factorsim/","The project page assigns the first author Fan-Yun Sun and most authors to Stanford University; NVIDIA is the second institution. The logo is an official Stanford touch icon linked by https://identity.stanford.edu/.",[242,116,297],[1672,1482,1580,297],[1754,1755,1756,1757,1585],"code-world-model","simulation-generation","POMDP","benchmark",[1759,1760],{"_78":1439,"_50":1749},{"_78":1761,"_50":1762},"Paper v2 scope","https://arxiv.org/html/2409.17652v2",[1764],{"_78":1386,"_50":1765},"https://arxiv.org/abs/2409.17652","使用因子化 POMDP 表示，减少每一步生成所需上下文，面向代理训练生成 2D 游戏模拟。机器人实验在既有 CLIPort 框架内生成物体状态、奖励结构等任务代码。NeurIPS 2024 论文的游戏基准覆盖八个 Pygame 环境，3D 游戏生成仍属未来工作；机器人实验的 3D 相关性不等于能生成完整物理引擎。",[1771,1772],[1754,1755,1756,1757,1585],[1688,1505,1597,303],[257,133,303],{"_78":1453,"_50":1749},{"_78":1761,"_50":1762},"resource:poe-world","poe-world","PoE-World","组合小型程序专家，建模具有随机性的世界动态。","/zh/resources/poe-world/",{"_44":1774,"_1397":1775,"_1395":303,"_76":1446,"_1396":1776,"_1391":1814,"_50":1813,"_88":1815,"_1372":1816,"_1367":1817,"_1364":1818,"_1358":1403,"_1355":1429},[1780,1781,1782,1783,1784,1785,1786,1787,1788,1789,1790,1791,1792,1793],{"_76":46,"_80":1775,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":131,"_80":1776,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1394,"_80":297,"_82":1395,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1392,"_80":1445,"_82":76,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1389,"_80":1814,"_82":1391,"_84":85,"_86":60},{"_76":88,"_78":1386,"_90":1811,"_82":50,"_84":-7},{"_76":88,"_78":1378,"_90":1805,"_82":88,"_84":-7},{"_76":1359,"_78":1370,"_1361":1362,"_90":1801,"_82":1372,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1365,"_1361":1362,"_90":1800,"_82":1367,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1360,"_1361":1362,"_90":1799,"_82":1364,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1356,"_80":1357,"_82":1358,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1353,"_80":1429,"_82":1355,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_82":1350,"_78":1351,"_80":1798,"_86":87},{"_76":88,"_82":1345,"_78":1346,"_90":1794},[1795],{"_78":1796,"_50":1797},"Cornell University","https://arxiv.org/pdf/2505.10819","The original paper lists Cornell University, University of Cambridge, The Alan Turing Institute, and Dalhousie University. Select Cornell, the first listed institution and the first-author institution. The SVG is the official Cornell CS homepage identity, also used for WorldCoder.",[242,297],[1672,1482,297],[1754,1802,1803,1583,1804],"program-synthesis","stochastic-dynamics","model-based-planning",[1806,1807],{"_78":1809,"_50":1810},{"_78":1439,"_50":1808},"https://topwasu.github.io/poe-world","源码","https://github.com/topwasu/poe-world",[1812],{"_78":1386,"_50":1813},"https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.10819","把 LLM 合成的程序组成指数加权的专家乘积，用少量观察学习复杂随机世界模型，并在 Pong 和 Montezuma's Revenge 中接入规划器，研究样本效率及新关卡泛化。它是程序化动态建模方法，不是美术生成工具。",[1819,1820],[1754,1802,1803,1583,1804],[1688,1505,303],[257,303],{"_78":1821,"_50":1810},{"_78":1453,"_50":1808},"Code","resource:cwm-general-game-playing","cwm-general-game-playing","Code World Models for General Game Playing","将自然语言游戏规则编译成可验证模拟器，用于 MCTS 规划。","/zh/resources/cwm-general-game-playing/",{"_44":1823,"_1397":1824,"_1395":303,"_76":1446,"_1396":1825,"_1391":1856,"_50":1855,"_1372":1857,"_1367":1858,"_1364":1859,"_1358":1403,"_1355":1429},[1829,1830,1831,1832,1833,1834,1835,1836,1837,1838,1839,1840,1841],{"_76":46,"_80":1824,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":131,"_80":1825,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1394,"_80":297,"_82":1395,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1392,"_80":1445,"_82":76,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1389,"_80":1856,"_82":1391,"_84":85,"_86":60},{"_76":88,"_78":1386,"_90":1853,"_82":50,"_84":-7},{"_76":1359,"_78":1370,"_1361":1362,"_90":1848,"_82":1372,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1365,"_1361":1362,"_90":1847,"_82":1367,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1360,"_1361":1362,"_90":1846,"_82":1364,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1356,"_80":1357,"_82":1358,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1353,"_80":1429,"_82":1355,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_82":1350,"_78":1351,"_80":1845,"_86":87},{"_76":88,"_82":1345,"_78":1346,"_90":1842},[1843],{"_78":1668,"_50":1844},"https://arxiv.org/html/2510.04542v1","The original paper lists Google DeepMind as the authors’ affiliation. Use the avatar embedded by the official google-deepmind organization page, https://github.com/google-deepmind; not an author portrait.",[242,297],[1672,1482,1580,297],[1754,1849,1850,1851,1852],"game-rules","MCTS","formal-simulator","imperfect-information",[1854],{"_78":1386,"_50":1855},"https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.04542","根据规则和游戏轨迹生成 Python 状态转移、合法动作与终止函数，并为规划生成启发式价值及隐藏状态推断函数。论文评估十个完全或部分可观察游戏，包括棋盘与卡牌。能否避免非法动作取决于合成规则是否正确，模型验证仍然必要。",[1754,1849,1850,1851,1852],[1688,1505,1597,303],[257,303],"resource:gif-mcts-cwm","gif-mcts-cwm","GIF-MCTS / Code World Models Benchmark","通过生成、改进与修复的树搜索，合成可运行环境模型。","/zh/resources/gif-mcts-cwm/",{"_44":1861,"_1397":1862,"_1395":303,"_76":1446,"_1396":1863,"_1391":1898,"_50":1897,"_88":1899,"_1372":1900,"_1367":1901,"_1364":1902,"_1358":1451,"_1355":1429},[1867,1868,1869,1870,1871,1872,1873,1874,1875,1876,1877,1878,1879,1880],{"_76":46,"_80":1862,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":131,"_80":1863,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1394,"_80":297,"_82":1395,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1392,"_80":1445,"_82":76,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1389,"_80":1898,"_82":1391,"_84":85,"_86":60},{"_76":88,"_78":1386,"_90":1895,"_82":50,"_84":-7},{"_76":88,"_78":1378,"_90":1890,"_82":88,"_84":-7},{"_76":1359,"_78":1370,"_1361":1362,"_90":1888,"_82":1372,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1365,"_1361":1362,"_90":1887,"_82":1367,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1360,"_1361":1362,"_90":1886,"_82":1364,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1356,"_80":1430,"_82":1358,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1353,"_80":1429,"_82":1355,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_82":1350,"_78":1351,"_80":1885,"_86":87},{"_76":88,"_82":1345,"_78":1346,"_90":1881},[1882],{"_78":1883,"_50":1884},"Aalto University","https://sites.google.com/view/code-world-models/home","The authors’ project page explicitly lists Nicola Dainese, Matteo Merler, Minttu Alakuijala, and Pekka Marttinen under Aalto University. The logo URL is the official Aalto homepage touch icon, provided and verified by the root agent.",[242,116,297],[1672,1482,1580,297],[1754,1802,1850,1757,1889,1585],"CWMB",[1891,1892],{"_78":1893,"_50":1894},{"_78":1439,"_50":1884},"Code and CWMB","https://github.com/nicoladainese96/code-world-models",[1896],{"_78":1386,"_50":1897},"https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.15383","用 Python 表达状态转移、奖励与终止逻辑，由轨迹和测试反馈引导 GIF-MCTS 搜索。论文还发布覆盖 18 个强化学习环境的 CWMB，用于检查模型正确性与下游规划，是代码世界模型的基础阅读与评估参考。",[1903,1904],[1754,1802,1850,1757,1889,1585],[1688,1505,1597,303],[257,133,303],{"_78":1893,"_50":1894},{"_78":1453,"_50":1884},"resource:worldcoder","worldcoder","WorldCoder","从环境交互归纳 Python 世界模型，再在模型内进行规划。","/zh/resources/worldcoder/",{"_44":1906,"_1397":1907,"_1395":303,"_76":1446,"_1396":1908,"_1391":1936,"_50":1935,"_1372":1937,"_1367":1938,"_1364":1939,"_1358":1451,"_1355":1429},[1912,1913,1914,1915,1916,1917,1918,1919,1920,1921,1922,1923,1924],{"_76":46,"_80":1907,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":131,"_80":1908,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1394,"_80":297,"_82":1395,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":