{"_76":46,"_80":1994,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":131,"_80":1995,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1394,"_80":297,"_82":1395,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1392,"_80":1445,"_82":76,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1389,"_80":2033,"_82":1391,"_84":85,"_86":60},{"_76":88,"_78":1386,"_90":2030,"_82":50,"_84":-7},{"_76":88,"_78":1378,"_90":2026,"_82":88,"_84":-7},{"_76":1359,"_78":1370,"_1361":1362,"_90":2020,"_82":1372,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1365,"_1361":1362,"_90":2019,"_82":1367,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1360,"_1361":1362,"_90":2018,"_82":1364,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1356,"_80":1962,"_82":1358,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1353,"_80":1354,"_82":1355,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_82":1350,"_78":1351,"_80":2017,"_86":87},{"_76":88,"_82":1345,"_78":1346,"_90":2013},[2014],{"_78":2015,"_50":2016},"Nanjing University","https://arxiv.org/pdf/2608.27168","Paper page 1 identifies first author Xiaoyu Zhan with affiliations 1 and 2: Mogo AI Ltd. and Nanjing University. Select the first author’s university affiliation. Other authors also represent the University of Southampton. This logo is the official Nanjing University/Computer Science header identity from https://cs.nju.edu.cn/; an authentic Magpie project favicon is separately linked by the author site at https://zhanxy.xyz/Magpie-website/magpie-mark.png.",[116,297],[1482,1369,297],[2021,2022,2023,2024,2025],"hybrid-renderer","executable-state","game-engine","render-server","research",[2027],{"_78":2028,"_50":2029},"Paper v1 latency and limitations","https://arxiv.org/html/2608.27168v1",[2031],{"_78":1386,"_50":2032},"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.27168","设计者在传统引擎中定义场景与规则，运行时由引擎处理玩家输入和状态，再由渲染服务将白盒帧转为最终视觉。该分工主要降低原型对完整美术资产的依赖。论文仍记录分块交互延迟与视觉一致性限制，不能直接视为生产就绪的游戏渲染器。",[2021,2022,2023,2024,2025],[1505,1404,303],[133,303],[2038],{"_78":2028,"_50":2029},"resource:coder-world-model","coder-world-model","CoDeR — Code Plans, Diffusion Renders","多代理共同构建可执行世界，再由扩散模型渲染观察结果。","/zh/resources/coder-world-model/",{"_44":2040,"_1397":2041,"_1395":303,"_76":1446,"_1396":2042,"_1391":2076,"_50":2075,"_88":2077,"_1372":2078,"_1367":2079,"_1364":2080,"_1358":1987,"_1355":1429},[2046,2047,2048,2049,2050,2051,2052,2053,2054,2055,2056,2057,2058,2059],{"_76":46,"_80":2041,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":131,"_80":2042,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1394,"_80":297,"_82":1395,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1392,"_80":1445,"_82":76,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1389,"_80":2076,"_82":1391,"_84":85,"_86":60},{"_76":88,"_78":1386,"_90":2073,"_82":50,"_84":-7},{"_76":88,"_78":1378,"_90":2070,"_82":88,"_84":-7},{"_76":1359,"_78":1370,"_1361":1362,"_90":2067,"_82":1372,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1365,"_1361":1362,"_90":2066,"_82":1367,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1360,"_1361":1362,"_90":2065,"_82":1364,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1356,"_80":1962,"_82":1358,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1353,"_80":1429,"_82":1355,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_82":1350,"_78":1351,"_80":2064,"_86":87},{"_76":88,"_82":1345,"_78":1346,"_90":2060},[2061],{"_78":2062,"_50":2063},"University of Science and Technology of China","https://arxiv.org/html/2609.26458v1","The original CoDeR paper lists USTC and TongYi Lab; USTC is the first listed institutional affiliation. Select USTC while preserving TongYi Lab as a collaborator. The PNG is used as the school-icon image in the header and footer of the official English university homepage.",[116,297],[1672,1482,297],[1754,2068,2021,2069,2025],"multi-agent","persistent-state",[2071],{"_78":1439,"_50":2072},"https://becauseimbatman0.github.io/CoDeR",[2074],{"_78":1386,"_50":2075},"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.26458","Code Plans, Diffusion Renders 使用五种协作角色，把概念转成规则、代码与观察，让实体在视野之外持续演化。论文研究长期记忆、开放式交互和多代理世界；摘要称代码与权重将发布，应区分论文报告与当前可获取文件。",[2081],[1754,2068,2021,2069,2025],[1688,1505,303],[133,303],{"_78":1453,"_50":2072},"resource:programmable-world-model","programmable-world-model","Programmable World Model","用显式全局状态与可编程规则，保持视野外实体的持续性。","/zh/resources/programmable-world-model/",{"_44":2083,"_1397":2084,"_1395":303,"_76":1446,"_1396":2085,"_1391":2119,"_50":2118,"_88":2120,"_1372":2121,"_1367":2122,"_1364":2123,"_1358":1987,"_1355":1429},[2089,2090,2091,2092,2093,2094,2095,2096,2097,2098,2099,2100,2101,2102],{"_76":46,"_80":2084,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":131,"_80":2085,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1394,"_80":297,"_82":1395,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1392,"_80":1445,"_82":76,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1389,"_80":2119,"_82":1391,"_84":85,"_86":60},{"_76":88,"_78":1386,"_90":2116,"_82":50,"_84":-7},{"_76":88,"_78":1378,"_90":2112,"_82":88,"_84":-7},{"_76":1359,"_78":1370,"_1361":1362,"_90":2110,"_82":1372,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1365,"_1361":1362,"_90":2109,"_82":1367,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1360,"_1361":1362,"_90":2108,"_82":1364,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1356,"_80":1962,"_82":1358,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1353,"_80":1429,"_82":1355,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_82":1350,"_78":1351,"_80":2107,"_86":87},{"_76":88,"_82":1345,"_78":1346,"_90":2103},[2104],{"_78":2105,"_50":2106},"Alaya Lab","https://alaya-lab.github.io/pwm/","The official project page and repository explicitly identify Alaya Lab. The logo is the official lab favicon linked by https://alayalab.ai/. A white variant is also linked there at assets/brand/alaya-lab-icon-white.svg. No university affiliation is inferred.",[116,297],[1482,1580,297],[1754,2022,2021,2069,2111],"CombatStateBench",[2113],{"_78":2114,"_50":2115},"Project and release progress","https://github.com/AlayaLab/pwm",[2117],{"_78":1386,"_50":2118},"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.10540","代理把指令转成实体状态与状态转移程序，轻量引擎维护全局状态，再将有状态的 3D 定向包围盒和相机轨迹编译为视频模型控制。论文提出 CombatStateBench，检查实体计数与不可逆状态。公开仓库目前以项目文档为主，完整推理代码和权重是否可用需另行确认。",[2124],[1754,2022,2021,2069,2111],[1505,1597,303],[133,303],{"_78":2114,"_50":2115},"resource:code-world-model-brain"