再分发，因此不能仅凭这些文件原样复现完整代理到引擎流程。",[2168,2169,2170],[1754,2150,2022,2021,2151,2152],[1688,1505,303],[133,303],{"_78":1453,"_50":1114},{"_78":1494,"_50":2159},{"_78":2157,"_50":2158},"resource:streamrender-h3","由代码引擎维护世界状态，通过流式扩散渲染语义地图。",{"_44":372,"_1397":368,"_1395":303,"_76":1500,"_1396":2172,"_1391":2214,"_50":360,"_88":2215,"_1372":2216,"_1367":2217,"_1364":2218,"_1358":1987,"_1355":1354},[2175,2176,2177,2178,2179,2180,2181,2182,2183,2184,2185,2186,2187,2188,2189],{"_76":46,"_80":368,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":131,"_80":2172,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1394,"_80":297,"_82":1395,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1392,"_80":1499,"_82":76,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1389,"_80":2214,"_82":1391,"_84":85,"_86":60},{"_76":88,"_78":1386,"_90":2212,"_82":50,"_84":-7},{"_76":88,"_78":1378,"_90":2199,"_82":88,"_84":-7},{"_76":1359,"_78":1370,"_1361":1362,"_90":2196,"_82":1372,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1365,"_1361":1362,"_90":2195,"_82":1367,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1360,"_1361":1362,"_90":2194,"_82":1364,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1356,"_80":1962,"_82":1358,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1353,"_80":1354,"_82":1355,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":1626,"_82":1627,"_78":1628,"_101":364,"_110":365,"_57":360,"_83":357},{"_76":77,"_82":1350,"_78":1351,"_80":2193,"_86":87},{"_76":88,"_82":1345,"_78":1346,"_90":2190},[2191],{"_78":2192,"_50":360},"NVIDIA Research","The official project page footer identifies StreamRender-H3 as NVIDIA Research. The full, original vertical NVIDIA logo is supplied by the official NVIDIA Logo and Brand Guidelines page.",[116,297],[1482,1369,297],[2021,2022,1967,2197,2151,2198],"three.js","NVIDIA",[2200,2201,2202,2203],{"_78":2210,"_50":2211},{"_78":2208,"_50":2209},{"_78":2206,"_50":2207},{"_78":2204,"_50":2205},"Weights and component licenses","https://huggingface.co/Efficient-Large-Model/StreamRender-H3","Pinned runtime source","https://github.com/NVlabs/Sana/tree/0527465fdcbbf27180a76419a4e73643aa1aac73/models/streamrender_h3","Agent workflow","https://nvlabs.github.io/Sana/Sol-Engine/docs/agent-workflow/","Sol-Engine","https://nvlabs.github.io/Sana/Sol-Engine/",[2213],{"_78":1386,"_50":360},"NVIDIA Sol-Engine 的 Interactive Coding Worlds 使用 three.js 赛车游戏：引擎处理地图、物理、碰撞和输入，两步流式 MiniMax-H3 根据首帧与提示词渲染语义视频。公开训练和测试覆盖这一个游戏及第三人称视角，语义颜色代表类别而非独立物体。扩散渲染计时使用八张 GB200，因果解码器另在单张 GB200 测量；独立阶段耗时不能等同端到端输入显示延迟。运行源码与权重包已公开，各组件条款不同。",[2219,2220,2221,2222],[2021,2022,1967,2197,2151,2198],[1505,1404,303],[133,303],{"_78":2210,"_50":2211},{"_78":2208,"_50":2209},{"_78":2206,"_50":2207},{"_78":2204,"_50":2205},"resource:solarrenderer","把引擎或代理生成的结构视频，转成带风格的最终画面。",{"_44":305,"_1397":300,"_1395":303,"_76":1446,"_1396":2224,"_1391":2269,"_50":290,"_88":2270,"_1372":2271,"_1367":2272,"_1364":2273,"_1358":1987,"_1355":1429},[2227,2228,2229,2230,2231,2232,2233,2234,2235,2236,2237,2238,2239,2240,2241],{"_76":46,"_80":300,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":131,"_80":2224,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1394,"_80":297,"_82":1395,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1392,"_80":1445,"_82":76,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1389,"_80":2269,"_82":1391,"_84":85,"_86":60},{"_76":88,"_78":1386,"_90":2267,"_82":50,"_84":-7},{"_76":88,"_78":1378,"_90":2252,"_82":88,"_84":-7},{"_76":1359,"_78":1370,"_1361":1362,"_90":2249,"_82":1372,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1365,"_1361":1362,"_90":2248,"_82":1367,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1360,"_1361":1362,"_90":2247,"_82":1364,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1356,"_80":1962,"_82":1358,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1353,"_80":1429,"_82":1355,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":1626,"_82":1627,"_78":1628,"_101":295,"_110":296,"_57":290,"_83":2246},{"_76":77,"_82":1350,"_78":1351,"_80":2245,"_86":87},{"_76":88,"_82":1345,"_78":1346,"_90":2242},[2243],{"_78":2244,"_50":290},"National University of Singapore","First author Guian Fang is affiliation 1 (NUS). The author page also lists LIGHTSPEED, CUHK(SZ), SLAI, and HKUST(GZ). Use the complete vertical logo from the official NUS identity page, not an isolated shield: https://www.nus.edu.sg/identity/elements-of-the-nus-logo. The displayed shield is the official NUS website icon supplied by the School of Computing website; this does not assign the paper to that school.","SolarRenderer authors · model output",[242,116,297],[1482,1369,297],[2021,2250,1967,2151,2251,1488],"structure-conditioning","LoRA",[2253,2254,2255,2256,2257],{"_78":1809,"_50":2266},{"_78":2264,"_50":2265},{"_78":2262,"_50":2263},{"_78":2260,"_50":2261},{"_78":2258,"_50":2259},"Usage guide","https://github.com/Junchao-cs/SolarWM/blob/main/docs/solar_renderer.md","Data and evaluation","https://huggingface.co/datasets/Enderfga/SolarRenderer-Data","Weights","https://huggingface.co/Enderfga/SolarRenderer","Paper PDF","https://enderfga.cn/data/solarrenderer.pdf","https://github.com/Enderfga/SolarRenderer",[2268],{"_78":1386,"_50":290},"Few-Step Generative Reference Rendering 用语义图、灰盒、骨骼、深度等结构条件控制 MiniMax-H3，也支持首帧和文本。控制与四步 LoRA 包含块因果变体。代码为 Apache-2.0，权重采用有地区限制的 MiniMax H3 Community License，数据各部分条款不同，包含非商业和仅研究部分。世界状态与规则仍由上游程序维护；四步采样不等于已能在消费级硬件实时交互。",[2274,2275,2276,2277,2278],[2021,2250,1967,2151,2251,1488],[1505,1404,303],[257,133,303],{"_78":1821,"_50":2266},{"_78":2264,"_50":2265},{"_78":2262,"_50":2263},{"_78":2260,"_50":2261},{"_78":2258,"_50":2259},"resource:level-design-book-skill","level-design-book-skill","The Level Design Book · 社区关卡设计 Skill","基于 The Level Design Book 的非官方通用技能包，覆盖关卡简报、灰盒、遭遇、引导和基于试玩记录的评审。","/zh/resources/level-design-book-skill/",{"_44":2280,"_1397":2281,"_1395":2358,"_76":2335,"_1396":2282,"_1391":2355,"_50":2318,"_88":2359,"_1372":2360,"_1367":2361,"_1364":2362,"_1358":1987,"_1355":1429,"_2314":2363},[2287,2288,2289,2290,2291,2292,2293,2294,2295,2296,2297,2298,2299,2300,2301,2302,2303,2304,2305,2306],"Level Design Book · unofficial design skill",{"_76":46,"_80":2281,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":131,"_80":2282,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60}