ns and templates, not a runnable demo — No engine plugin, executable level, benchmark result, or validated playtest is supplied.","教程",[2326],{"_78":2327,"_50":2328,"_2319":2329},"Read the original book","https://book.leveldesignbook.com/","The underlying book remains authoritative. The skill reorganizes guidance and templates rather than claiming universal design laws or independently measured outcomes.",[116,242],[1672,1369,1580,2332],"构建与发布",[2334,2335,2336,2337,2338,2339,2340,2341],"level-design","skill","blockout","playtesting","agent-neutral","CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0","noncommercial","unofficial-adaptation",[2343,2344,2345,2346],{"_78":2352,"_50":2328},{"_78":2351,"_50":2310},{"_78":2349,"_50":2350},{"_78":2347,"_50":2348},"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 legal code","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode","Book licensing and third-party exceptions","https://book.leveldesignbook.com/appendix/license","Original authors and contributors","The Level Design Book",[2354],{"_78":1386,"_50":2318},"英文包包含任务分流、十三份主题与来源参考，以及三份可复用模板，主要面向 3D 关卡；用于 2D 时需明确调整的假设。包内记录 2026-10-16 快照，自述覆盖 94 项来源索引并包含未完成部分，不能当作独立运行或设计质量验证。原始写作署名 Robert Yang 与包括 Andrew Yoder 在内的贡献者，属于社区改编，而非官方书籍版本或 pi 维护者发布。采用 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0，需保留署名和改动声明、遵守非商业及相同方式共享条件，并检查第三方例外；这些条款不会自动授权每个游戏输出。","技能包","游戏制作","production",[2373,2374,2375,2376],[2334,2335,2336,2337,2338,2339,2340,2341],[1688,1404,1597,2372],[133,257],{"_2364":2365,"_43":2366,"_57":2367},"tutorial",{"_78":2327,"_50":2328,"_42":2364,"_2319":2329},{"_78":2369,"_42":2370,"_2319":2371},{"_78":2317,"_50":2318,"_42":2368,"_2319":2320},"full-source","Instructions and templates, not a runnable demo","unavailable","No engine plugin, executable level, benchmark result, or validated playtest is supplied.","ship",{"_78":2352,"_50":2328},{"_78":2351,"_50":2310},{"_78":2349,"_50":2350},{"_78":2347,"_50":2348},"resource:playwright-test","playwright-test","Playwright Test","提供 DOM 操作、断言和截图比较的浏览器测试框架。","/zh/resources/playwright-test/",{"_44":2378,"_1397":2379,"_1395":