k implementation; engine setup, model services, and dataset assets remain separate requirements.",[3822],{"_78":3823,"_50":3824,"_2319":3825},"Game-generation video","https://github.com/Pluto156/AutoUE/blob/main/assets/show.mp4","Recorded demonstrations of generated Unreal games; no public browser-playable build verified.",[3827],{"_78":3828,"_50":3829,"_2319":3830},"Setup and usage","https://github.com/Pluto156/AutoUE#setup-and-usage","Author instructions for dependencies, service credentials, and running the Unreal generation pipeline.",[116],[1672,1482,1368,1369,1580],[737,3771,3834,3773],"Multi-agent",[3836,3837,3838],{"_78":1445,"_50":3843},{"_78":3841,"_50":3842},{"_78":3839,"_50":3840},"Pinned evaluation dispatcher","https://github.com/Pluto156/AutoUE/blob/8686a4d51c19813f2b3368bd73f685a940db7531/PCGGen_UE/Plugins/LLMEditor/Source/LLMEditor/Private/Core/EvaluateExecutor/EvaluateExecutor.cpp#L174-L186","Generated games and asset dataset","https://huggingface.co/datasets/Pluto156/AutoUE_DataSet","https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.07106",[3845],{"_78":1386,"_50":725},"从游戏描述生成 UE 场景与 C++ 玩法，公开实现包含配置说明、演示视频，以及生成游戏与资产的数据集链接。复现需要 Unreal 集成和外部模型服务，演示视频不是托管试玩。固定版本评估调度器的静态代码显示，移动命令被跳过、交互处理器被直接调用，因此脚本路径完成并不能证明玩家成功导航。",[3855,3856,3857],{"_2364":3852,"_43":3853,"_57":3854},[737,3771,3834,3773],[1688,1505,174,1404,1597],[133],{"_78":3828,"_50":3829,"_42":2364,"_2319":3830},{"_78":3823,"_50":3824,"_42":100,"_2319":3825},{"_78":3756,"_50":725,"_42":3381,"_2319":3820},{"_78":3789,"_50":3843},{"_78":3841,"_50":3842},{"_78":3839,"_50":3840},"resource:blenderllm","blenderllm","BlenderLLM / BlendNet / CADBench","研究文本到 Blender 脚本的系统，配有训练数据与建模基准。","/zh/resources/blenderllm/",{"_44":3859,"_1397":3860,"_1395":133,"_76":1446,"_1396":3861,"_1391":3904,"_50":3882,"_88":3905,"_1372":3906,"_1367":3907,"_1364":3908,"_1358":1451,"_1355":1354},[3865,3866,3867,3868,3869,3870,3871,3872,3873,3874,3875,3876,3877,3878],{"_76":46,"_80":3860,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":131,"_80":3861,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1394,"_80":3716,"_82":1395,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1392,"_80":1445,"_82":76,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1389,"_80":3904,"_82":1391,"_84":85,"_86":60},{"_76":88,"_78":1386,"_90":3902,"_82":50,"_84":-7},{"_76":88,"_78":1378,"_90":3891,"_82":88,"_84":-7},{"_76":1359,"_78":1370,"_1361":1362,"_90":3886,"_82":1372,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1365,"_1361":1362,"_90":3885,"_82":1367,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1360,"_1361":1362,"_90":3884,"_82":1364,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1356,"_80":1430,"_82":1358,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1353,"_80":1354,"_82":1355,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_82":1350,"_78":1351,"_80":3883,"_86":87},{"_76":88,"_82":1345,"_78":1346,"_90":3879},[3880],{"_78":3881,"_50":3882},"The Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen · School of Data Science","https://github.com/FreedomIntelligence/BlenderLLM","The official README's About section explicitly says the team is from the School of Data Science, CUHK Shenzhen. The university logo is linked on its official English homepage. CUHK Shenzhen is identified distinctly from CUHK in Hong Kong.",[116],[1368,1580],[3887,3888,3889,3890],"Text-to-bpy","CADBench","数据集","Modeling benchmark",[3892,3893,3894,3895],{"_78":1445,"_50":3901},{"_78":3899,"_50":3900},{"_78":3888,"_50":3898},{"_78":3896,"_50":3897},"Pinned release dataset description","https://github.com/FreedomIntelligence/BlenderLLM/blob/f778bfd6992ddd675f7615d0eaf965a8576f2879/README.md#L44-L50","https://huggingface.co/datasets/FreedomIntelligence/CADBench","BlendNet dataset","https://huggingface.co/datasets/FreedomIntelligence/BlendNet","https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.14203",[3903],{"_78":1386,"_50":3882},"BlenderLLM 从用户指令生成 bpy 建模脚本。仓库与公开数据文档记录约 12K 组 BlendNet 配对，CADBench 包含合成与论坛任务。评估集中在基础 CAD 风格建模和指令遵循；README 说明高级材质、多模态输入与多轮协作的限制，它不是游戏创作基准。",[3910,3911,3912,3913],[3887,3888,3909,3890],[174,1597],[133],"Dataset",{"_78":3789,"_50":3901},{"_78":3899,"_50":3900},{"_78":3888,"_50":3898},{"_78":3896,"_50":3897},"resource:video2game","把真实世界视频重建成可在浏览器交互的 3D 环境。",{"_44":884,"_1397":880,"_1395":133,"_76":1446,"_1396":3915,"_1391":3952,"_50":3951,"_88":3953,"_1372":3954,"_1367":3955,"_1364":3956,"_1358":1451,"_1355":1354},[3918,3919,3920,3921,3922,3923,3924,3925,3926,3927,3928,3929,3930,3931],{"_76":46,"_80":880,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":131,"_80":3915,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1394,"_80":3716,"_82":1395,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1392,"_80":1445,"_82":76,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1389,"_80":3952,"_82":1391,"_84":85,"_86":60},{"_76":88,"_78":1386,"_90":3949,"_82":50,"_84":-7},{"_76":88,"_78":1378,"_90":3943,"_82":88,"_84":-7},{"_76":1359,"_78":1370,"_1361":1362,"_90":3939,"_82":1372,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1365,"_1361":1362,"_90":3938,"_82":1367,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1360,"_1361":1362,"_90":3937,"_82":1364,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1356,"_80":1430,"_82":1358,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1353,"_80":1354,"_82":1355,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_82":1350,"_78":1351,"_80":3936,"_86":87},{"_76":88,"_82":1345,"_78":1346,"_90":3932},[3933],{"_78":3934,"_50":3935},"University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign","https://arxiv.org/html/2404.09833","The paper lists first author Hongchi Xia at both UIUC and Shanghai Jiao Tong University, with coauthors at UIUC and Cornell. UIUC is one verified first-author affiliation. This is its official brand CDN icon, linked by illinois.edu.",[116],[1368,1369,297],[3940,3941,920,3942],"Video-to-3D","Reconstruction","Collision",[3944,3945],{"_78":1445,"_50":3948},{"_78":3946,"_50":3947},"Pinned engine-handoff recommendations","https://github.com/video2game/video2game/blob/7bcf8ae754240b9fd2de75a154eb73c75a146b79/readme.md#L256-L273","https://arxiv.org/abs/2404.09833",[3950],{"_78":1386,"_50":3951},"https://github.com/video2game/video2game","视频与相机信息经过重建、网格提取、外观烘焙和碰撞生成，进入 three.js 游戏环境。文档中的 UE 路线建议完全漫反射的烘焙网格，将烘焙高光维度设为零。它采用显式环境重建，仍有手工场景设置与物理集成，与预测下一帧的交互视频世界模型不同。",[3957,3958],[3940,3941,920,3942],[174,1404,303],[133],{"_78":3789,"_50":3948},{"_78":3946,"_50":3947},"resource:holodeck","根据文本布置带家具、可交互的 3D 室内环境。",{"_44":136,"_1397":123,"_1395":133,"_76":1500,"_1396":3960,"_1391":3997,"_50":3996,"_88":3998,"_1372":3999,"_1367":4000,"_1364":4001,"_1358":4002,"_1355":1429},[3963,3964,3965,3966,3967,3968,3969,3970,3971,3972,3973,3974,3975,3976,3977],{"_76":46,"_80":123,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":131,"_80":3960,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1394,"_80":3716,"_82":1395,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1392,"_80":1499,"_82":76,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1389,"_80":3997,"_82":1391,"_84":85,"_86":60},{"_76":88,"_78":1386,"_90":3994,"_82":50,"_84":-7},{"_76":88,"_78":1378,"_90":3991,"_82":88,"_84":-7},{"_76":1359,"_78":1370,"_1361":1362,"_90":3986,"_82":1372,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1365,"_1361":1362,"_90":3985,"_82":1367,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1360,"_1361":1362,"_90":3984,"_82":1364,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1356,"_80":3983,"_82":1358,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1353,"_80":1429,"_82":1355,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":1626,"_82":1627,"_78":1628,"_101":104,"_110":109,"_57":94,"_83":81},{"_76":77,"_82":1350,"_78":1351,"_80":3982,"_86":87},{"_76":88,"_82":1345,"_78":1346,"_90":3978},[3979],{"_78":3980,"_50":3981},"Allen Institute for AI · Ai2","https://arxiv.org/html/2312.09067","The official code is hosted by allenai, and the paper lists multiple Allen Institute authors alongside collaborators at UPenn, Stanford, and the University of Washington. The icon comes from Ai2's official homepage. This represents the code-hosting research institution, not an exclusive affiliation for every author.","2023",[116],[1672,1369],[3987,3988,3989,3990],"Text-to-scene","AI2-THOR","Spatial constraints","Embodied environments",[3992],{"_78":1445,"_50":3993},"https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.09067",[3995],{"_78":1386,"_50":3996},"https://github.com/allenai/Holodeck","结合语言规划、资产检索与空间约束，将房间需求转成 AI2-THOR 场景，并提供 Unity 加载说明。评估主要面向具身 AI 环境生成，可借鉴布局与语义交互方法，但不能直接视为完整游戏关卡设计或商业发布方案。",[4003],[3987,3988,3989,3990],[1688,1404],[133],2023,{"_78":3789,"_50":3993},"resource:infinigen","程序化生成自然与室内 Blender 场景，以及配套合成数据。",{"_44":175,"_1397":169,"_1395":133,"_76":1500,"_1396":4005,"_1391":4040,"_50":4026,"_88":4041,"_1372":4042,"_1367":4043,"_1364":4044,"_1358":4002,"_1355":1429},[4008,4009,4010,4011,4012,4013,4014,4015,4016,4017,4018,4019,4020,4021,4022],{"_76":46,"_80":169,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":131,"_80":4005,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1394,"_80":3716,"_82":1395,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1392,"_80":1499,"_82":76,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1389,"_80":4040,"_82":1391,"_84":85,"_86":60},{"_76":88,"_78":1386,"_90":4038,"_82":50,"_84":-7},{"_76":88,"_78":1378,"_90":4035,"_82":88,"_84":-7},{"_76":1359,"_78":1370,"_1361":1362,"_90":4031,"_82":1372,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1365,"_1361":1362,"_90":4030,"_82":1367,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1360,"_1361":1362,"_90":4029,"_82":1364,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1356,"_80":3983,"_82":1358,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1353,"_80":1429,"_82":1355,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":1626,"_82":1627,"_78":1628,"_101":164,"_110":4028,"_57":160,"_83":157},{"_76":77,"_82":1350,"_78":1351,"_80":4027,"_86":87},{"_76":88,"_82":1345,"_78":1346,"_90":4023},[4024],{"_78":4025,"_50":4026},"Princeton University · Vision & Learning Lab","https://github.com/princeton-vl/infinigen","The official repository is maintained by Princeton Vision & Learning Lab. The lab's official cs.princeton.edu homepage links this orange lab icon. It is the real lab identity rather than a reconstructed university seal.","Official Infinigen samples of procedurally generated forests, underwater scenes, deserts, and mountains",[116],[1368,1369,1580],[2493,4032,4033,4034],"Blender","Synthetic data","场景",[4036],{"_78":4037,"_50":160},"Project and paper",[4039],{"_78":1386,"_50":4026},"由随机种子、参数和资产生成器产生几何、材质、场景及标注，并提供 OBJ、OpenUSD 等导出文档。它是程序化系统，而非语言模型，可为 AI 开发流程提供可控场景与数据；实时游戏还需要优化、碰撞和玩法集成。",[4046],[2493,4032,4033,4045],[174,1404,1597],[133],"Scenes",{"_78":4037,"_50":160},"resource:triposr","从单张图像快速重建 3D 物体，适合资产原型制作。",{"_44":626,"_1397":623,"_1395":133,"_76":1398,"_1396":4048,"_1391":4075,"_50":613,"_1372":4076,"_1367":4077,"_1364":4078,"_1358":1451,"_1355":1429},[4051,4052,4053,4054,4055,4056,4057,4058,4059,4060,4061,4062,4063],{"_76":46,"_80":623,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":131,"_80":4048,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1394,"_80":3716,"_82":1395,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1392,"_80":1393,"_82":76,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1389,"_80":4075,"_82":1391,"_84":85,"_86":60},{"_76":88,"_78":1386,"_90":4073,"_82":50,"_84":-7},{"_76":1359,"_78":1370,"_1361":1362,"_90":4070,"_82":1372,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1365,"_1361":1362,"_90":4069,"_82":1367,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1360,"_1361":1362,"_90":4068,"_82":1364,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1356,"_80":1430,"_82":1358,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1353,"_80":1429,"_82":1355,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_82":1350,"_78":1351,"_80":4067,"_86":87},{"_76":88,"_82":1345,"_78":1346,"_90":4064},[4065],{"_78":4066,"_50":613},"Tripo AI · VAST","The official README explicitly says TripoSR was collaboratively developed by Tripo AI and Stability AI. The VAST-AI-Research organization links to tripo3d.ai. This shows Tripo/VAST as one verified co-developer, not as the sole author.",[116],[1368],[3583,3941,4071,4072],"Mesh","Prototype assets",[4074],{"_78":1386,"_50":613},"使用 LRM 风格的前馈重建，公开代码、预训练模型与演示，将图像转为可导出的物体网格。重点是单个物体，隐藏表面、拓扑和游戏性能需后续处理，不是完整场景或可玩游戏生成器。",[3583,3941,4071,4072],[174],[133],"resource:trellis","通过结构化潜在表示，生成网格、高斯和辐射场等 3D 输出。",{"_44":210,"_1397":207,"_1395":133,"_76":1398,"_1396":4080,"_1391":4112,"_50":4100,"_88":4113,"_1372":4114,"_1367":4115,"_1364":4116,"_1358":1451,"_1355":1429},[4083,4084,4085,4086,4087,408