rxiv.org/abs/2502.07128",[4598],{"_78":1386,"_50":4599},"https://github.com/danruili/Cardiverse","通过机制图与检索，从卡牌描述生成变体和代码，再用生成的对局记录迭代检查规则一致性。仓库也包含玩法 AI 竞技场，但开发贡献主要是规则与代码原型。公开替代规则说明与论文原始输入不同，复现时应注意。",[4605],[4590,4591,4592,4593],[1688,1505,1597],[257],{"_78":3789,"_50":4596},"resource:gavel","gavel","GAVEL","结合语言模型与质量多样性搜索，生成棋盘游戏规则。","/zh/resources/gavel/",{"_44":4607,"_1397":4608,"_1395":257,"_76":1500,"_1396":4609,"_1391":4645,"_50":4644,"_88":4646,"_1372":4647,"_1367":4648,"_1364":4649,"_1358":1451,"_1355":1429},[4613,4614,4615,4616,4617,4618,4619,4620,4621,4622,4623,4624,4625,4626],{"_76":46,"_80":4608,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":131,"_80":4609,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1394,"_80":4409,"_82":1395,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1392,"_80":1499,"_82":76,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1389,"_80":4645,"_82":1391,"_84":85,"_86":60},{"_76":88,"_78":1386,"_90":4642,"_82":50,"_84":-7},{"_76":88,"_78":1378,"_90":4639,"_82":88,"_84":-7},{"_76":1359,"_78":1370,"_1361":1362,"_90":4634,"_82":1372,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1365,"_1361":1362,"_90":4633,"_82":1367,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1360,"_1361":1362,"_90":4632,"_82":1364,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1356,"_80":1430,"_82":1358,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1353,"_80":1429,"_82":1355,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_82":1350,"_78":1351,"_80":4631,"_86":87},{"_76":88,"_82":1345,"_78":1346,"_90":4627},[4628],{"_78":4629,"_50":4630},"New York University · Tandon School of Engineering","https://arxiv.org/html/2407.09388","The paper lists first author Graham Todd and Julian Togelius at NYU Tandon. Other authors list ETH Zurich, Flinders, UCLouvain, and Maastricht. This identifies the first author's institution using NYU Tandon's own website icon.",[242],[1672,1482,1580],[4635,4636,4637,4638],"Game design","Ludii","Evolutionary search","Rule generation",[4640],{"_78":1445,"_50":4641},"https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.09388",[4643],{"_78":1386,"_50":4644},"https://github.com/gdrtodd/gavel","以 Ludii 游戏描述代码为表示，由语言模型变异和重组规则，再通过模拟与搜索筛选游戏。代码、实验及相关模型和数据参考均有公开内容。输出限定在规则系统内的棋盘游戏，不能据此推断通用 2D 动作游戏开发能力。",[4650],[4635,4636,4637,4638],[1688,1505,1597],[257],{"_78":3789,"_50":4641},"resource:mariogpt","mariogpt","MarioGPT","用 GPT 根据文本描述生成马里奥风格的可玩关卡布局。","/zh/resources/mariogpt/",{"_44":4652,"_1397":4653,"_1395":257,"_76":1446,"_1396":4654,"_1391":4694,"_50":4680,"_88":4695,"_1372":4696,"_1367":4697,"_1364":4698,"_1358":4002,"_1355":1429},[4658,4659,4660,4661,4662,4663,4664,4665,4666,4667,4668,4669,4670,4671,4672],{"_76":46,"_80":4653,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":131,"_80":4654,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1394,"_80":4409,"_82":1395,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1392,"_80":1445,"_82":76,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1389,"_80":4694,"_82":1391,"_84":85,"_86":60},{"_76":88,"_78":1386,"_90":4692,"_82":50,"_84":-7},{"_76":88,"_78":1378,"_90":4689,"_82":88,"_84":-7},{"_76":1359,"_78":1370,"_1361":1362,"_90":4684,"_82":1372,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1365,"_1361":1362,"_90":4683,"_82":1367,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1360,"_1361":1362,"_90":4682,"_82":1364,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1356,"_80":3983,"_82":1358,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1353,"_80":1429,"_82":1355,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":1626,"_82":1627,"_78":1628,"_101":4678,"_110":4679,"_57":4680,"_83":4681},{"_76":77,"_82":1350,"_78":1351,"_80":4677,"_86":87},{"_76":88,"_82":1345,"_78":1346,"_90":4673},[4674],{"_78":4675,"_50":4676},"IT University of Copenhagen","https://arxiv.org/html/2302.05981","The paper lists first author Shyam Sudhakaran at IT University of Copenhagen and modl.ai; other authors also list ITU and modl.ai. Uses the university's official English logo. This is one verified affiliation rather than exclusive institutional authorship.","/GameMap/media/demos/mariogpt.webp","First frame of the official MarioGPT interactive demo, showing a Mario-style platform level","https://github.com/shyamsn97/mario-gpt","Ma