242,116],[1482,1580],[4729,4730,4731,4732],"Functional verification","Playwright","Runtime state","Verifier Skill",[4734],{"_78":1445,"_50":4735},"https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.07442",[4737],{"_78":1386,"_50":4738},"https://github.com/NetX-lab/GameGen-Verifier","把游戏需求拆成独立检查点，通过浏览器和运行时适配器验证功能。仓库提供 GGV-Harness 及 Codex、Claude 验证技能，但不包含全部生成游戏、运行输出与私有配置。状态钩子提供的观察能力高于纯黑盒试玩，比较结果时应区分。",[4744],[4729,4730,4731,4732],[1505,1597],[257,133],{"_78":3789,"_50":4735},"resource:gamexpert-bench","gamexpert-bench","GameXpert-Bench","从游戏创建、缺陷修复与迭代优化三个方向评估游戏开发。","/zh/resources/gamexpert-bench/",{"_44":4746,"_1397":4747,"_1395":257,"_76":1757,"_1396":4748,"_1391":4784,"_50":4783,"_88":4785,"_1372":4786,"_1367":4787,"_1364":4788,"_1358":1987,"_1355":1429},[4752,4753,4754,4755,4756,4757,4758,4759,4760,4761,4762,4763,4764,4765],{"_76":46,"_80":4747,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":131,"_80":4748,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1394,"_80":4409,"_82":1395,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1392,"_80":4333,"_82":76,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1389,"_80":4784,"_82":1391,"_84":85,"_86":60},{"_76":88,"_78":1386,"_90":4781,"_82":50,"_84":-7},{"_76":88,"_78":1378,"_90":4777,"_82":88,"_84":-7},{"_76":1359,"_78":1370,"_1361":1362,"_90":4773,"_82":1372,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1365,"_1361":1362,"_90":4772,"_82":1367,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1360,"_1361":1362,"_90":4771,"_82":1364,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1356,"_80":1962,"_82":1358,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1353,"_80":1429,"_82":1355,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_82":1350,"_78":1351,"_80":4770,"_86":87},{"_76":88,"_82":1345,"_78":1346,"_90":4766},[4767],{"_78":4768,"_50":4769},"Institute of Automation, Chinese Academy of Sciences","https://arxiv.org/html/2608.21833","The paper lists first author Kun Chen at MAIS, Institute of Automation, Chinese Academy of Sciences. It also lists Tsinghua, HKUST, CUHK Shenzhen, Tencent Lightspeed Studios, and the Tencent Hunyuan team. The institute icon is linked by its official identity page https://ia.cas.cn/gkjj/xxbs/. Affiliation is representative, not exclusive.",[242,116],[1672,1482,1580],[4319,4774,4775,4776],"Bug fixing","Iterative improvement","Full release pending",[4778],{"_78":4779,"_50":4780},"Repository and release status","https://github.com/Kwen-Chen/GameXpert-Bench",[4782],{"_78":1386,"_50":4783},"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.21833","论文提出 GameGen、GameFix 和 GameOpt，使用完整开发轨迹研究单次生成之外的生命周期。核查时官方仓库仍在准备数据和评估代码，应将其作为论文与协议参考，而非已经可直接运行的基准。",[4789],[4319,4774,4775,4776],[1688,1505,1597],[257,133],{"_78":4779,"_50":4780},"resource:gamedevbench","gamedevbench","GameDevBench","在已有 Godot 项目中评估编程代理完成开发任务的能力。","/zh/resources/gamedevbench/",{"_44":4791,"_1397":4792,"_1395":257,"_76":1757,"_1396":4793,"_1391":4827,"_50":4826,"_88":4828,"_1372":4829,"_1367":4830,"_1364":4831,"_1358":1987,"_1355":1429},[4797,4798,4799,4800,4801,4802,4803,4804,4805,4806,4807,4808,4809,4810],{"_76":46,"_80":4792,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":131,"_80":4793,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1394,"_80":4409,"_82":1395,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1392,"_80":4333,"_82":76,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1389,"_80":4827,"_82":1391,"_84":85,"_86":60},{"_76":88,"_78":1386,"_90":4824,"_82":50,"_84":-7},{"_76":88,"_78":1378,"_90":4821,"_82":88,"_84":-7},{"_76":1359,"_78":1370,"_1361":1362,"_90":4818,"_82":1372,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1365,"_1361":1362,"_90":4817,"_82":1367,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1360,"_1361":1362,"_90":4816,"_82":1364,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1356,"_80":1962,"_82":1358,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1353,"_80":1429,"_82":1355,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_82":1350,"_78":1351,"_80":4815,"_86":87},{"_76":88,"_82":1345,"_78":1346,"_90":4811},[4812],{"_78":4813,"_50":4814},"Carnegie Mellon University","https://arxiv.org/html/2602.11103","The paper lists first author Wayne Chi and most coauthors at Carnegie Mellon; one coauthor is at Princeton. This represen