按模块学习；官方 Fab 条目将其内容限定用于基于 Unreal Engine 的产品。",[737,5453,5454,5455,5456],[1688,1505,1404,1597],[133],[5469],{"_78":5459,"_50":5460},"resource:unreal-automation-tests","unreal-automation-tests","Unreal · Automation Test Framework","UE 官方测试基础设施，支持单元、功能、内容压力和截图比较测试。","/zh/resources/unreal-automation-tests/",{"_44":5471,"_1397":5472,"_1395":4960,"_76":1398,"_1396":5473,"_1391":5505,"_50":5504,"_1372":5506,"_1367":5507,"_1364":5508,"_1355":1429,"_88":5509},[5477,5478,5479,5480,5481,5482,5483,5484,5485,5486,5487,5488,5489],{"_76":46,"_80":5472,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":131,"_80":5473,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1394,"_80":4959,"_82":1395,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1392,"_80":1393,"_82":76,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1389,"_80":5505,"_82":1391,"_84":85,"_86":60},{"_76":88,"_78":1386,"_90":5502,"_82":50,"_84":-7},{"_76":88,"_78":1378,"_90":5498,"_82":88,"_84":-7},{"_76":1359,"_78":1370,"_1361":1362,"_90":5494,"_82":1372,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1365,"_1361":1362,"_90":5493,"_82":1367,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1360,"_1361":1362,"_90":5492,"_82":1364,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1353,"_80":1429,"_82":1355,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_82":1350,"_78":1351,"_80":5413,"_86":87},{"_76":88,"_82":1345,"_78":1346,"_90":5490},[5491],{"_78":2738,"_50":5412},[242,116],[1482,1369,1580,2332],[737,5495,5496,2406,5497],"Automated testing","Blueprint","Content validation",[5499],{"_78":5500,"_50":5501},"Command-line reports and interrupted-run resumption","https://dev.epicgames.com/documentation/en-us/unreal-engine/run-automation-tests-in-unreal-engine",[5503],{"_78":1386,"_50":5504},"https://dev.epicgames.com/documentation/en-us/unreal-engine/automation-test-framework-in-unreal-engine","可将 Blueprint 编译、关卡加载、模拟输入与视觉回归接入代理反馈循环，并结合 Functional Testing 等接口。测试在引擎内运行，需要正确插件和状态清理。ResumeRunTest 读取已有 JSON 报告，继续 NotRun 测试，并把中断时仍在运行的测试标为失败；应保存报告并区分编辑器与客户端测试环境。",[737,5495,5496,2406,5497],[1505,1404,1597,2372],[257,133],[5510],{