":5623},"包含瓦片碰撞查询、可破坏地图和调色板切换等源场景。项目记录 Unity 6000.3.3f1、URP 17.3.0 与 Input System 1.17.0，README 则称支持 2021.1 及以后。manifest 选择 2d-extras 的 package_6000.3 Git 分支，锁文件却记录 registry 6.0.1，测试前应解析并固定依赖，分别核验导入、运行和版本兼容性。",[3278,242,5628,5034,5035],[1505,174,1404,1597],[257],[5646,5647,5648],{"_78":5637,"_50":5638},{"_78":5635,"_50":5636},{"_78":5633,"_50":5634},"resource:unity-test-framework","unity-test-framework","Unity Test Framework","Unity 官方测试框架，支持 Edit mode、Play mode 和命令行执行。","/zh/resources/unity-test-framework/",{"_44":5650,"_1397":5651,"_1395":4960,"_76":1398,"_1396":5652,"_1391":5686,"_50":5685,"_88":5687,"_1372":5688,"_1367":5689,"_1364":5690,"_1355":1429},[5656,5657,5658,5659,5660,5661,5662,5663,5664,5665,5666,5667,5668],{"_76":46,"_80":5651,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":131,"_80":5652,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1394,"_80":4959,"_82":1395,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1392,"_80":1393,"_82":76,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1389,"_80":5686,"_82":1391,"_84":85,"_86":60},{"_76":88,"_78":1386,"_90":5683,"_82":50,"_84":-7},{"_76":88,"_78":1378,"_90":5676,"_82":88,"_84":-7},{"_76":1359,"_78":1370,"_1361":1362,"_90":5673,"_82":1372,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1365,"_1361":1362,"_90":5672,"_82":1367,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1360,"_1361":1362,"_90":5671,"_82":1364,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1353,"_80":1429,"_82":1355,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_82":1350,"_78":1351,"_80":5624,"_86":87},{"_76":88,"_82":1345,"_78":1346,"_90":5669},[5670],{"_78":3278,"_50":5623},[242,116],[1482,1580,2332],[3278,1580,5674,5675,4272],"Edit mode","Play mode",[5677,5678],{"_78":5681,"_50":5682},{"_78":5679,"_50":5680},"Versioned test-job and cancellation API","https://docs.unity3d.com/Packages/com.unity.test-framework@1.4/api/UnityEditor.TestTools.TestRunner.Api.TestRunnerApi.html","Package and API documentation","https://docs.unity3d.com/Packages/com.unity.test-framework@latest/",[5684],{"_78":1386,"_50":5685},"https://docs.unity3d.com/6000.2/Documentation/Manual/test-framework/test-framework-introduction.html","可持续回归检查生成脚本及场景行为，使用跨帧 UnityTest 检查生命周期、协程与状态变化。Edit mode 和 Play mode 的执行循环不同，应等待真实帧或条件，而不只检查脚本文件生成。所检查的 Test Framework 1.4.6 API 返回任务 GUID，取消时有跨帧清理：活动用例变为 Canceled，剩余用例为 NotRun。取消不能算通过，Editor 与包版本的兼容性需分别确认。",[5692,5693],[3278,5691,5674,5675,4287],[1505,1597,2372],[257,133],"Testing",{"_78":5681,"_50":5682},{"_78":5679,"_50":5680},"resource:unity-engine","unity-engine","Unity · Manual","Unity 官方手册，覆盖项目、编辑器、脚本、渲染、物理、资产导入与发布。","/zh/resources/unity-engine/",{"_44":5695,"_1397":5696,"_1395":4960,"_76":1398,"_1396":5697,"_1391":5728,"_50":5727,"_88":5729,"_1372":5730,"_1367":5731,"_1364":5732,"_1355":1429},[5701,5702,5703,5704,5705,5706,5707,5708,5709,5710,5711,5712,5713],{"_76":46,"_80":5696,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":131,"_80":5697,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1394,"_80":4959,"_82":1395,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1392,"_80":1393,"_82":76,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1389,"_80":5728,"_82":1391,"_84":85,"_86":60},{"_76":88,"_78":1386,"_90":5725,"_82":50,"_84":-7},{"_76":88,"_78":1378,"_90":5722,"_82":88,"_84":-7},{"_76":1359,"_78":1370,"_1361":1362,"_90":5718,"_82":1372,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1365,"_1361":1362,"_90":5717,"_82":1367,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1360,"_1361":1362,"_90":5716,"_82":1364,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1353,"_80":1429,"_82":1355,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_82":1350,"_78":1351,"_80":5624,"_86":87},{"_76":88,"_82":1345,"_78":1346,"_90":5714},[5715],{"_78":3278,"_50":5623},[242,116],[1672,1482,1368,1369,1580,2332],[3278,5719,5071,5720,5721],"C#","Editor","Package Manager",[5723],{"_78":5724,"_50":5623},"Official example source",[5726],{"_78":1386,"_50":5727},"https://docs.unity3d.com/Manual/index.html","提供具体的 C#、编辑器项目约束，以及 2D / 3D 工作流和版本化包参考。固定 Editor、渲染管线和 Package Manager 的版本组合；仅凭 Unity 名称无法判断 API 或材质兼容性。",[5733],[3278,5719,5071,5720,5721],[1688,1505,174,1404,1597,2372],[257,133],{"_78":5724