by the repository and creator profile, but no independent project graphic logo was found. The README has Godot ASCII art only. Do not use a default identicon, a personal photograph, or the Godot engine logo as creator branding.",[242,116],[1482,1369,1580],[4196,4233,5809,6095,4034],"Runtime logs",[6097],{"_78":6098,"_50":6099},"Pinned implementation and lifecycle limits","https://github.com/Coding-Solo/godot-mcp/blob/1209744fad78f3998f98c7394fd0f6ef50da5281/src/index.ts#L1053-L1215",[6101],{"_78":1386,"_50":6090},"支持执行项目、采集调试输出、创建场景与节点、加载 Sprite2D 纹理及部分 3D MeshLibrary 操作，但不覆盖全部编辑器功能或视觉试玩。所检查版本只保留一个活动项目进程：启动新进程前发出 kill，却不等待旧进程退出；停止操作也仅发送请求。自然退出会清除 get_debug_output 使用的句柄，可靠的崩溃记录需另行归档日志。",[4196,4233,5809,6095,4045],[1505,1404,1597],[257,133],[6107],{"_78":6098,"_50":6099},"resource:unity-mcp-skill","unity-mcp-skill","Unity-MCP Operator Guide","MCP for Unity 的操作指南：先检查编辑器状态，再执行、等待编译与域重载，最后核验结果。","/zh/resources/unity-mcp-skill/",{"_44":6109,"_1397":6110,"_1395":5973,"_76":2335,"_1396":6111,"_1391":6140,"_50":6139,"_1372":6141,"_1367":6142,"_1364":6143,"_1355":1429},[6115,6116,6117,6118,6119,6120,6121,6122,6123,6124,6125,6126],{"_76":46,"_80":6110,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":131,"_80":6111,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1394,"_80":5972,"_82":1395,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1392,"_80":2356,"_82":76,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1389,"_80":6140,"_82":1391,"_84":85,"_86":60},{"_76":88,"_78":1386,"_90":6137,"_82":50,"_84":-7},{"_76":1359,"_78":1370,"_1361":1362,"_90":6134,"_82":1372,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1365,"_1361":1362,"_90":6133,"_82":1367,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1360,"_1361":1362,"_90":6132,"_82":1364,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1353,"_80":1429,"_82":1355,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_82":1350,"_78":1351,"_80":6131,"_86":87},{"_76":88,"_82":1345,"_78":1346,"_90":6127},[6128],{"_78":6129,"_50":6130},"MCP for Unity / CoplayDev","https://github.com/CoplayDev/unity-mcp","Exact MCP for Unity project logo from its README. Independent community integration, explicitly not affiliated with Unity Technologies. The operator guide belongs to the same repository.",[242,116],[1482,1369,1580],[3278,6135,4233,6136,4278],"Skills","Compilation feedback",[6138],{"_78":1386,"_50":6139},"https://github.com/CoplayDev/unity-mcp/blob/main/unity-mcp-skill/SKILL.md","以资源查询为起点组织场景操作，继续编辑前检查编译、域重载、工具就绪状态及阻塞原因。脚本修改后检查控制台与截图。它提供 MCP for Unity 的操作流程；具体示例和参数取决于桥接、Unity、UI 与输入系统版本。",[3278,6135,4233,6136,4278],[1505,1404,1597],[257,133],"resource:unity-mcp","unity-mcp","MCP for Unity","将通用编程代理连接到 Unity Editor 的社区 MCP 桥接。","/zh/resources/unity-mcp/",{"_44":6145,"_1397":6146,"_1395":5973,"_76":1398,"_1396":6147,"_1391":6178,"_50":6130,"_88":6179,"_1372":6180,"_1367":6181,"_1364":6182,"_1355":1354},[6151,6152,6153,6154,6155,6156,6157,6158,6159,6160,6161,6162,6163],{"_76":46,"_80":6146,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":131,"_80":6147,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1394,"_80":5972,"_82":1395,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1392,"_80":1393,"_82":76,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1389,"_80":6178,"_82":1391,"_84":85,"_86":60},{"_76":88,"_78":1386,"_90":6176,"_82":50,"_84":-7},{"_76":88,"_78":1378,"_90":6169,"_82":88,"_84":-7},{"_76":1359,"_78":1370,"_1361":1362,"_90":6168,"_82":1372,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1365,"_1361":1362,"_90":6167,"_82":1367,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1360,"_1361":1362,"_90":6166,"_82":1364,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1353,"_80":1354,"_82":1355,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_82":1350,"_78":1351,"_80":6131,"_86":87},{"_76":88,"_82":1345,"_78":1346,"_90":6164},[6165],{"_78":6129,"_50":6130},[242,116],[1482,1368,1369,1580,2332],[3278,4233,6009,6050,5719],[6170,6171],{"_78":6174,"_50":6175},{"_78":6172,"_50":6173},"Pinned installation requirements","https://github.com/CoplayDev/unity-mcp/blob/aa5fc638d623f56178d50329d9ad8c541a57fe66/website/docs/getting-started/install.md#L13-L17","Installation and tool documentation","https://coplaydev.github.io/unity-mcp/",[6177],{"_78":1386,"_50":6130},"提供场景、GameObject、C# 脚本、资产与测试等编辑器操作。安装说明要求 Unity 2021.3 LTS 或更新版本、Python 3.10+ 和 uv，这些是文档声明的要求。项目独立于 Unity Technologies；应固定桥接与编辑器版本，检查编译、截图和 PlayMode 测试。",[6183,6184],[3278,4233,6009,6050,5719],[1505,174,1404,1597,2372],[257,133],{"_78":6174,"_50":6175},{"_78":6172,"_50":6173},"resource:codex-browser-games","codex-browser-games","Codex · Create Browser-based Games","OpenAI 的浏览器游戏开发流程，涵盖规划、项目指令、资产生成和浏览器迭代。","/zh/resources/codex-browser-games/",{"_44":6186,"_1397":6187,"_1395":5973,"_76":2569,"_1396":6188,"_1391":6216,"_50":6215,"_1372":6217,"_1367":6218,"_1364":6219,"_1355":1429},[6192,6193,6194,6195,6196,6197,6198,6199,6200,6201,6202,6203],{"_76":46,"_80":6187,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":131,"_80":6188,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1394,"_80":5972,"_82":1395,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1392,"_80":2568,"_82":76,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1389,"_80":6216,"_82":1391,"_84":85,"_86":60},{"_76":88,"_78":1386,"_90":6213,"_82":50,"_84":-7},{"_76":1359,"_78":1370,"_1361":1362,"_90":6210,"_82":1372,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1365,"_1361":1362,"_90":6209,"_82":1367,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1360,"_1361":1362,"_90":6208,"_82":1364,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1353,"_80":1429,"_82":1355,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_82":1350,"_78":1351,"_80":6207,"_86":87},{"_76":88,"_82":1345,"_78":1346,"_90":6204},[6205],{"_78":4401,"_50":6206},"https://github.com/openai/codex","Official OpenAI coding agent and OpenAI-authored workflow. Use the OpenAI brand mark, not a generated substitute.",[242,116],[1672,1482,1368,1580,2332],[6211,2801,1672,4730,6212],"Official workflow","Asset consistency",[6214],{"_78":1386,"_50":6215},"https://learn.chatgpt.com/use-cases/browser-games","先明确玩家目标、核心循环、输入和胜负条件，再结合 PLAN.md 与 AGENTS.md 实现。将图像技能和 Playwright 用于视觉与交互反馈。这是一份实践指南，不是针对所有游戏类型的性能保证或研究基准。",[6211,4877,6220,4730,6212],[1688,1505,174,1597,2372],[257,133],"Planning","resource:agent-skills-format","agent-skills-format","把领域流程打包成 SKILL.md 指令、脚本和参考资料的开放格式。","/zh/resources/agent-skills-format/",{"_44":6222,"_1397":4271,"_1395":5973,"_76":2569,"_1396":6223,"_1391":6252,"_50":6242,"_1372":6253,"_1367":6254,"_1364":6255,"_1355":1429},[6227,6228,6229,6230,6231,6232,6233,6234,6235,6236,6237,6238],{"_76":46,"_80":4271,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":131,"_80":6223,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1394,"_80":5972,"_82":1395,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1392,"_80":2568,"_82":76,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1389,"_80":6252,"_82":1391,"_84":85,"_86":60},{"_76":88,"_78":1386,"_90":6250,"_82":50,"_84":-7},{"_76":1359,"_78":1370,"_1361":1362,"_90":6246,"_82":1372,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1365,"_1361":1362,"_90":6245,"_82":1367,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1360,"_1361":1362,"_90":6244,"_82":1364,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1353,"_80":1429,"_82":1355,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_82":1350,"_78":1351,"_80":6243,"_86":87},{"_76":88,"_82":1345,"_78":1346,"_90":6239},[6240],{"_78":6241,"_50":6242},"Anthropic","https://agentskills.io/home","The official format website states Agent Skills was originally developed by Anthropic. Label as creator; the open format is adopted across the ecosystem.",[242,116,297],[1672,1482,1368,1369,1580,2332],[6135,6247,6248,6249],"Open format","Workflows","Progressive loading",[6251],{"_78":1386,"_50":6242},"适合精灵归一化、GLB 导出、场景检查和回归测试等可重复任务，按需加载领域知识。技能包提供流程与资料；引擎控制仍需要相应工具、依赖和兼容客户端。",[6135,6247,6248,6249],[1688,1505,174,1404,1597,2372],[257,133,303],"resource:agents-md","agents-md","AGENTS.md","用 Markdown 向编程代理说明构建命令、测试规则和项目约定的开放格式。","/zh/resources/agents-md/",{"_44":6257,"_1397":6258,"_1395":5973,"_76":2569,"_1396":6259,"_1391":6287,"_50":6278,"_1372":6288,"_1367":6289,"_1364":6290,"_1355":1429},[6263,6264,6265,6266,6267,6268,6269,6270,6271,6272,6273,6274],{"_76":46,"_80":6258,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":131,"_80":6259,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1394,"_80":5972,"_82":1395,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1392,"_80":2568,"_82":76,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1389,"_80":6287,"_82":1391,"_84":85,"_86":60},{"_76":88,"_78":1386,"_90":6285,"_82":50,"_84":-7},{"_76":1359,"_78":1370,"_1361":1362,"_90":6282,"_82":1372,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1365,"_1361":1362,"_90":6281,"_82":1367,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1360,"_1361":1362,"_90":6280,"_82":1364,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1353,"_80":1429,"_82":1355,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_82":1350,"_78":1351,"_80":6279,"_86":87},{"_76":88,"_82":1345,"_78":1346,"_90":6275},[6276],{"_78":6277,"_50":6278},"Agentic AI Foundation","https://agents.md/","AGENTS.md explicitly states current stewardship by the Agentic AI Foundation under the Linux Foundation. Logo is the AAIF author mark used on aaif.io, not an OpenAI ownership claim.",[242,116,297],[1672,1482,1580,2332],[6283,6284,6247,5160],"Project instructions","Project conventions",[6286],{"_78":1386,"_50":6278},"游戏项目可记录引擎版本、启动命令、目录规则、资产导入约定和验收检查，减少环境配置中的猜测。它是项目指令格式，而不是代理运行时；文件发现和配置方式因客户端而异。",[6283,6284,6247,5160],[1688,1505,1597,2372],[257,133,303],"resource:mini-swe-agent","mini-swe-agent","便于修改和检查执行轨迹的最小 Shell 编程代理研究基线。","/zh/resources/mini-swe-agent/",{"_44":6292,"_1397":6292,"_1395":5973,"_76":1500,"_1396":6293,"_1391":6329,"_50":6328,"_88":6330,"_1372":6331,"_1367":6332,"_1364":6333,"_1355":1429},[6297,6298,6299,6300,6301,6302,6303,6304,6305,6306,6307,6308,6309],{"_76":46,"_80":6292,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":131,"_80":6293,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1394,"_80":5972,"_82":1395,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1392,"_80":1499,"_82":76,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1389,"_80":6329,"_82":1391,"_84":85,"_86":60},{"_76":88,"_78":1386,"_90":6326,"_82":50,"_84":-7},{"_76":88,"_78":1378,"_90":6322,"_82":88,"_84":-7},{"_76":1359,"_78":1370,"_1361":1362,"_90":6317,"_82":1372,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1365,"_1361":1362,"_90":6316,"_82":1367,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1360,"_1361":1362,"_90":6315,"_82":1364,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1353,"_80":1429,"_82":1355,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_82":1350,"_78":1351,"_80":6314,"_86":87},{"_76":88,"_82":1345,"_78":1346,"_90":6310},[6311],{"_78":6312,"_50":6313},"mini-SWE-agent / SWE-agent","https://github.com/SWE-agent/mini-swe-agent/blob/main/mkdocs.yml","The official MkDocs configuration explicitly sets assets/mini_square.svg as both logo and favicon. Prefer the actual project mark over assigning one university from a multi-institution team.",[242,116,297],[1482,1580],[6318,6319,6320,6321,5200],"Research baseline","Shell","运行框架","Traces",[6323],{"_78":6324,"_50":6325},"Predecessor: SWE-agent","https://github.com/SWE-agent/SWE-agent",[6327],{"_78":1386,"_50":6328},"https://github.com/SWE-agent/mini-swe-agent","可研究模型、提示词和环境对游戏代码生成与修复的影响，也可封装无头引擎命令。最小循环在独立子进程中执行命令，而非持久 Shell，因此每次命令或脚本都要携带工作目录及环境配置。它面向通用软件工程，玩法、视觉和物理需要额外验证。",[6335],[6318,6319,6334,6321,5217],[1505,1597],[257,133,303],"Harness",{"_78":6324,"_50":6325},"resource:claude-agent-sdk","claude-agent-sdk","Claude Agent SDK","在 Python 或 TypeScript 应用中嵌入 Claude Code 的工具循环、权限、会话与扩展。","/zh/resources/claude-agent-sdk/",{"_44":6337,"_1397":6338,"_1395":5973,"_76":1500,"_1396":6339,"_1391":6368,"_50":6367,"_1372":6369,"_1367":6370,"_1364":6371,"_1355":1429},[6343,6344,6345,6346,6347,6348,6349,6350,6351,6352,6353,6354],{"_76":46,"_80":6338,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":131,"_80":6339,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1394,"_80":5972,"_82":1395,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1392,"_80":1499,"_82":76,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1389,"_80":6368,"_82":1391,"_84":85,"_86":60},{"_76":88,"_78":1386,"_90":6365,"_82":50,"_84":-7},{"_76":1359,"_78":1370,"_1361":1362,"_90":6361,"_82":1372,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1365,"_1361":1362,"_90":6360,"_82":1367,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1360,"_1361":1362,"_90":6359,"_82":1364,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_7