d in the same OpenHands organization.",[242,116,297],[1672,1482,1580],[6362,5158,6363,6400,6401],"Workspaces","Reproducible experiments",[6403,6404],{"_78":6407,"_50":6408},{"_78":6405,"_50":6406},"TypeScript client scope and stability","https://github.com/OpenHands/software-agent-sdk/blob/3f3294581ebf40f3bbe5b96aec1d28b7fec96226/clients/typescript/README.md#L1-L19","SDK documentation","https://docs.openhands.dev/sdk",[6410],{"_78":1386,"_50":6411},"https://github.com/OpenHands/software-agent-sdk","可把构建、场景检查和测试封装成代理工具。Python SDK 支持本地与远程工作区；所检查的 TypeScript 客户端仍为 alpha，仅支持通过 Agent Server 进行远程对话。固定客户端与服务端版本，避免假设接口一致；游戏专用工具和验收检查需要自行提供。",[6417,6418],[6362,5158,6363,6400,6401],[1688,1505,1597],[257,133,303],{"_78":6407,"_50":6408},{"_78":6405,"_50":6406},"resource:openhands","openhands","OpenHands · Agent Canvas","管理本地、远程和云端代理环境的开源开发控制台。","/zh/resources/openhands/",{"_44":6420,"_1397":6421,"_1395":5973,"_76":1500,"_1396":6422,"_1391":6452,"_50":6395,"_88":6453,"_1372":6454,"_1367":6455,"_1364":6456,"_1355":1429},[6426,6427,6428,6429,6430,6431,6432,6433,6434,6435,6436,6437,6438],{"_76":46,"_80":6421,"_82":1397,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":131,"_80":6422,"_82":1396,"_84":-7,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1394,"_80":5972,"_82":1395,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1392,"_80":1499,"_82":76,"_84":118,"_86":60},{"_76":77,"_78":1389,"_80":6452,"_82":1391,"_84":85,"_86":60},{"_76":88,"_78":1386,"_90":6450,"_82":50,"_84":-7},{"_76":88,"_78":1378,"_90":6447,"_82":88,"_84":-7},{"_76":1359,"_78":1370,"_1361":1362,"_90":6443,"_82":1372,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1365,"_1361":1362,"_90":6442,"_82":1367,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":1359,"_78":1360,"_1361":1362,"_90":6441,"_82":1364,"_84":-7,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_78":1353,"_80":1429,"_82":1355,"_84":118,"_86":87},{"_76":77,"_82":1350,"_78":1351,"_80":6396,"_86":87},{"_76":88,"_82":1345,"_78":1346,"_90":6439},[6440],{"_78":6394,"_50":6395},[242,116,297],[1672,1482,1580,2332],[6444,6445,3834,5200,6446],"Agent Canvas","Environments","Orch